WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.681
[MUSIC]

00:00:09.681 --> 00:00:10.459
Now you're mine.

00:00:10.459 --> 00:00:11.678
No escape this time.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.642
Do you feel that chill.

00:00:12.642 --> 00:00:14.024
Running up your spine.

00:00:14.024 --> 00:00:14.976
Don't look twice.

00:00:14.976 --> 00:00:16.276
I won't play nice.

00:00:16.276 --> 00:00:17.309
It's finally time for you.

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:18.482
To pay the price.

00:00:18.482 --> 00:00:19.573
Walk with me.

00:00:19.573 --> 00:00:20.154
Through the woods.

00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:20.522
You'll see.

00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:21.520
A lovely playground.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.774
For you and me.

00:00:22.774 --> 00:00:23.865
You're trapped this time.

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:25.115
I'm in your mind.

00:00:25.115 --> 00:00:26.241
We're not so different.

00:00:26.241 --> 00:00:27.410
You and I.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.490
I chased you through hallways.

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:29.036
And forests.

00:00:29.036 --> 00:00:29.697
And crawlways.

00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:30.707
Your body is breaking.

00:00:30.707 --> 00:00:31.749
And soon you'll be mine.

00:00:31.749 --> 00:00:32.910
Go back to the school.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.036
Where my children play.

00:00:34.036 --> 00:00:35.046
Now be a good boy.

00:00:35.046 --> 00:00:36.412
Come right this way.

00:00:36.412 --> 00:00:37.457
Do you think you've.

00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:38.502
Been through hell.

00:00:38.502 --> 00:00:39.547
Just wait til you're locked.

00:00:39.547 --> 00:00:40.836
Inside my cell.

00:00:40.836 --> 00:00:41.718
You can pray.

00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:42.879
Even pray to the pope.

00:00:42.879 --> 00:00:44.168
Just pray that you don't.

00:00:44.168 --> 00:00:45.639
Drop the soap.

00:00:45.639 --> 00:00:50.767
[MUSIC]

00:00:50.767 --> 00:01:00.767
[NOISE].

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:04.157
What!

00:01:06.653 --> 00:01:16.653
[MUSIC]

